<h2>10. Questions for management</h2>
<ol>
<li>What is the latest go-live date the business can accept if {{ v.vendor }} needs until 2027 to settle the address criterion?</li>
<li>Will Mainkai accept a lower approval rate for under-25s and recent arrivals in exchange for adopting the new score, and who signs off that trade-off?</li>
<li>Should cut-offs be set on the new score alone, or on a challenger strategy that runs old and new scores side by side for two quarters?</li>
<li>Does Mainkai's own default definition match {{ v.vendor }}'s target closely enough to map scores to pricing bands?</li>
